OL,3,AWhat failure of COP31 reveals about a
OL,4,Adivided world
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome may have found it ironic that the
OL,7,Fworld's biggest conference on climate
OL,8,Fchange should collapse over the very
OL,9,Fmention of fossil fuels - the main
OL,10,Fcause of global warming.
OL,12,FYet that is what happened in Antalya,
OL,13,FTurkey, on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe failure tells us something about
OL,16,Fthe state of climate diplomacy. But it
OL,17,Fmay tell us even more about the
OL,18,Fincreasingly divided world in which the
OL,19,Fnegotiations take place.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
