OL,3,AWhat failure of COP31 reveals about a
OL,4,Adivided world
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Bowen, the Australian minister
OL,7,Fwho led the negotiations, spoke of a
OL,8,Fbackdrop constituting "the most
OL,9,Fcomplicated and fraught geopolitical
OL,10,Fenvironment in living memory". The
OL,11,Fcompeting demands, he said, had become
OL,12,F"unbridgeable red lines".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
